Hello, welcome to my homepage. I am currently a Founder’s Postdoctoral Research Scientist at Department of Statistics, Columbia University. I am broadly interested in high-dimensional statistics, nonconvex optimization, mathematics of data, signal processing, machine learning, randomized algorithms, and related areas. 

Previously, I was a Novikov Postdoctoral Fellow in Mathematics at University of Maryland, College Park. Even before that, I received my PhD from the Mathematics Department at the University of Hong Kong, and got my BSc in Mathematics from Sun Yat-sen University. 
~~~


== News

- *(Sep 2026)* Our papers, [https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.21873 one-bit clustering] and [https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.21683 logistic regression], have been accepted to NeurIPS 2026.
 


 




 

 


 




 
 


 




 


  


 
 


 

 

 

 
 
 



 
